<%- include('../partials/page-banner', {
  eyebrow: 'About Salone Interior Missions',
  heading: 'A Christ-centered ministry serving Sierra Leone’s interior communities with Gospel hope and practical compassion.',
  description: 'Learn the story behind the ministry, the convictions that guide the work, and the long-term vision for evangelism, discipleship, church planting, and community transformation.'
}) %>

<section class="section-pad pt-0 bg-white about-story-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="image-stack-card">
          <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529156069898-49953e39b3ac?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80" alt="Mission team gathering with community members" class="img-fluid rounded-5 about-feature-image">
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <span class="eyebrow text-dark">Who we are</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-dark mt-3">A ministry shaped by presence, prayer, and faithful partnership.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Salone Interior Missions exists to carry the Gospel into underserved interior communities of Sierra Leone while helping local churches, families, and leaders grow in strength, dignity, and hope.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">What began as a burden for forgotten communities has grown into a ministry of village outreach, discipleship gatherings, child support, leadership development, and practical care. We believe transformation is strongest when it is rooted in local relationships and sustained over time.</p>
        <p class="text-muted mb-0">Our story is not built around visibility from a distance, but around walking closely with pastors, evangelists, children, and households who are already carrying the daily realities of ministry and community life.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream mission-vision-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-4">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="content-card h-100 highlight-card">
          <span class="eyebrow text-dark">Mission statement</span>
          <h2 class="section-title text-dark mt-3">To proclaim Christ, disciple believers, strengthen churches, and serve communities with compassion and integrity.</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">Our mission is to help interior communities encounter the Gospel in word and action through ministry that is pastoral, accountable, locally rooted, and spiritually faithful.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="content-card h-100 highlight-card alt-highlight-card">
          <span class="eyebrow text-dark">Vision statement</span>
          <h2 class="section-title text-dark mt-3">To see interior communities transformed by the love of Christ through thriving churches, equipped leaders, and resilient families.</h2>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We long for a future where the Gospel is deeply present, local believers are equipped for ministry, children are supported with dignity, and communities experience long-term renewal from within.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-white core-values-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-intro text-center mb-5">
