          <p class="text-muted mb-0">The Gospel is not an accessory to the work. It is the center of our message, motivation, and hope.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <div class="value-card h-100">
          <div class="icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-people"></i></div>
          <h3 class="h5 mt-4">Local partnership</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We serve alongside local pastors, leaders, and communities rather than above them or apart from them.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <div class="value-card h-100">
          <div class="icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i></div>
          <h3 class="h5 mt-4">Integrity and transparency</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We value clear stewardship, honest communication, and accountability in both ministry and support.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <div class="value-card h-100">
          <div class="icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-book"></i></div>
          <h3 class="h5 mt-4">Biblical discipleship</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We are committed to forming believers and leaders who grow in Scripture, prayer, and faithful service.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <div class="value-card h-100">
          <div class="icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-heart"></i></div>
          <h3 class="h5 mt-4">Compassion with dignity</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We respond to practical needs in ways that honor people, strengthen families, and avoid dependency-driven help.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-6 col-xl-4">
        <div class="value-card h-100">
          <div class="icon-badge"><i class="bi bi-arrow-repeat"></i></div>
          <h3 class="h5 mt-4">Long-term transformation</h3>
          <p class="text-muted mb-0">We care about lasting fruit, not short-lived impact. We invest for endurance, maturity, and resilient communities.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section-pad bg-cream why-exist-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row g-5 align-items-center">
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <span class="eyebrow text-dark">Why we exist</span>
        <h2 class="section-title text-dark mt-3">Interior communities often carry deep spiritual and practical needs with limited access to support.</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">Many rural and interior areas face a combination of ministry isolation, limited resources for children and families, under-supported church leaders, and a lack of long-term development opportunities. These realities create both spiritual hunger and tangible hardship.</p>
        <p class="text-muted">Salone Interior Missions exists because these communities matter deeply to God and should not be overlooked. We seek to respond with a ministry presence that is faithful to the Gospel and attentive to the realities people live with every day.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="col-lg-6">
        <div class="need-panel">
          <div class="need-item">
            <strong>Rural church leaders need encouragement</strong>
            <span>Pastors and evangelists often serve with little training, mentoring, or material support.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="need-item">
            <strong>Children need pathways of hope</strong>
            <span>Education support, mentorship, and consistent care can help children flourish with dignity.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="need-item">
            <strong>Communities need visible compassion</strong>
            <span>Mercy ministry, literacy support, and family strengthening reveal the love of Christ in practical ways.</span>
          </div>
          <div class="need-item">
            <strong>Transformation requires local trust</strong>
            <span>Enduring change grows through faithful presence, listening, and partnership with community leaders.</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

